<title>UK: Helaba Finance sets 100 million rand two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Helaba Finance sets 100 million rand two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN Amro Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HELABA FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN RAND  COUPON     14.625    MATURITY    04.MAR.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.767   PAY DATE    04.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.967    SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMS/LUX   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-5-10    SALE LIM US/UK/ZA/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC  =</p>
